  designNotes: 'Zeitgeist''s logistics, a film everyone quotes: send for any card
    from your deck; it joins your next hand. Was Multi Passport, the Shadow Ops.
    creature (its Ambush went to Femme Fatale).'
  artDescription: 'The Multipass shown to the camera, as in the film: on the left
    the cab driver with buzzed fair hair and stubble, an orange shirt under a dark
    vest; on the right the young woman with the bright orange bob and fringe, in
    a white top with orange suspenders, holding the Multipass up beside her face;
    a dim, crowded hall behind them.'
